{"id":"n56195-2-7","stage":3,"title":"물들다 · 沾染","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56195-2-7-1","ko":"네가 민준이한테 물들더니 나쁘게 변하는구나!","zh":"你都被敏俊影响了，变得这么差劲啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이한테","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"민준이한테","audio":"/audio/61ffa7b81d49a5485c64.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이한테","audio":"/audio/61ffa7b81d49a5485c64.mp3"}},{"text":"물들더니","meaning":"沾染，濡染，熏染","explanation":"물들다：沾染，濡染，熏染；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"물들다","audio":"/audio/2bd73104dcaef3ec3fbc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56195","senseId":"2","lemma":"물들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물들더니","audio":"/audio/87c902bbb9ed92885094.mp3"}},{"text":"나쁘게","meaning":"不良，坏","explanation":"나쁘다：不良，坏；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"1","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나쁘게","audio":"/audio/a3e241f61da548088079.mp3"}},{"text":"변하는구나!","meaning":"变，改变，变成","explanation":"변하다：变，改变，变成；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"변하다","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58881","senseId":"1","lemma":"변하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"변하는구나","audio":"/audio/e0223e8572fc551b2672.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"2bd73104dcaef3ec","term":"물들다","zh":"沾染，濡染，熏染","audio":"/audio/2bd73104dcaef3ec3fbc.mp3","entryId":"56195","definition":"受到外界的环境、行为、思想等的影响而被同化。","pronunciation":["물들다"]},{"id":"b67c592bde724aa1","term":"나쁘다","zh":"不良，坏","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3","entryId":"26816","definition":"不好。","pronunciation":["나쁘다"]},{"id":"35e71a5db7e3493c","term":"변하다","zh":"变，改变，变成","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3","entryId":"58881","definition":"成为其他东西或性质发生变动。","pronunciation":["변ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fd650ef2e17d10664d22.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56195-2-7-2","ko":"제 친구 욕하지 마세요!","zh":"请不要骂我的朋友！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제","meaning":"说话人对自己的谦称“저(我)”后加“의(的)”而成的“저의(我的)”的缩略。","explanation":"제：说话人对自己的谦称“저(我)”后加“의(的)”而成的“저의(我的)”的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75826","senseId":"1","lemma":"제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"친구","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}},{"text":"욕하지","meaning":"骂，辱骂","explanation":"욕하다：骂，辱骂；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"욕하다","audio":"/audio/ca8c53e4b70191e8c13a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26625","senseId":"1","lemma":"욕하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"욕하지","audio":"/audio/c22ac8d6db4f432a8a07.mp3"}},{"text":"마세요!","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마세요","audio":"/audio/0a355a328a450c9b0583.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b94e182b9a95d9dc","term":"제","zh":"说话人对自己的谦称“저(我)”后加“의(的)”而成的“저의(我的)”的缩略。","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3","entryId":"75826","definition":"说话人对自己的谦称“저(我)”后加“의(的)”而成的“저의(我的)”的缩略。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"ca8c53e4b70191e8","term":"욕하다","zh":"骂，辱骂","audio":"/audio/ca8c53e4b70191e8c13a.mp3","entryId":"26625","definition":"无视他人或说出责难的粗话。","pronunciation":["요카다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ccc783bb8f9a3ca9bbd9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.05,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56195","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.7034,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["请不要骂我的朋友！","承奎的长相看起来真凶狠啊。","你都被敏俊影响了，变得这么差劲啊！"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请不要骂我的朋友！","你都被敏俊影响了，变得这么差劲啊！","承奎的长相看起来真凶狠啊。"],"answer":0}]}
